{
  "description": "Test vectors for RegistryFederationRequest and RegistryFederationResponse (AMP v0.1.8). Covers federation requests, accepted responses with terms, and rejected responses. Signed requests: trust_proof is a base64 Ed25519 signature over canonical JSON of {type: 'ampro.registry.federation_request.v1', registry_id, audience, issued_at (RFC 3339 UTC 'Z'), nonce, capabilities (sorted)}; receivers additionally require audience == own URI, issued_at within +/-300 s and a single-use nonce. Revokes: base64 Ed25519 signature over canonical JSON of {type: 'ampro.registry.federation_revoke.v1', revoking_registry, revoked_registry, reason, effective_at (UTC 'Z')}. The signing registry for every signed case is the 'ed25519-c' key; expected_canonical is the exact signed string.",
  "keys": {
    "ed25519-c": {
      "type": "Ed25519",
      "private_seed_hex": "c5aa8df43f9f837bedb7442f31dcb7b166d38535076f094b85ce3a2e0b4458f7",
      "public_hex": "fc51cd8e6218a1a38da47ed00230f0580816ed13ba3303ac5deb911548908025",
      "source": "RFC 8032 section 7.1 TEST 3 secret key"
    }
  },
